(text "VBUCK3 senses the output bank. Keep FB3/divider away from SW3.\nHardware divider selects 1.5V before any firmware runs.\nDo not change BUCK3 to internal-divider mode in the bootloader." (at 177.8 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d32f87a-727a-5889-9362-f788b0cf4b67"))
(text "2 x 22uF input; 3 x 22uF local output, plus DDR-side bypass.\nUse the recorded Samsung DC-bias data for capacitance derating.\nKeep the VCC3 / SW3 / input-ground switching loop compact." (at 177.8 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ca69ab9-c714-57fb-a7e7-fde655a80cde"))
(text "Reference: RK809 Rev 1.7; AN_RK809 V1.1 section 6.2; Rockchip tablet p22.\n0.8V x (1 + 87.6k / 100k) = 1.5008V. Resistors: 0.1%, 25ppm/C.\nVerify ripple, load transients and cold/hot voltage against Hynix 1.425–1.575V limits." (at 15.24 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7363de9a-0bab-5075-ac5d-4dfd9b58a27d"))
)
